# MAPS 13 Nov 2026: MISSION 2, the mothballed Cobra outpost (Arbco Furniture Co., West Texas). 100 x 100 x 5 from 100 fixed 10x10 blocks.
# Each block uses one of three terrains (each under 255 parts); the script places block (gx,gy) at its slot with the OXCE `terrain:` key.
# Random clue spots are added per block by gen_clues (om2 section). Height 5: the wing has 4 floors + a roof (fallback: drop level 4 = roof only).
